OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Budget pass Burnham's
OL,4,AMakerfield test?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe community centre is in the heart of
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's
OL,8,Fconstituency, Makerfield, and they know
OL,9,Fall about budgeting here as it is run
OL,10,Fentirely by volunteers and has recently
OL,11,Fhad to raise thousands of pounds for a
OL,12,Fnew roof.
OL,14,FNorman Smith is one of the trustees. He
OL,15,Fsays running the centre comes with
OL,16,Ftremendous financial challenges.
